# Find the predicted classes for X_test
y_pred = skySurveyKnn.predict(X_test)

# Calculate accuracy score
score = accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred)

# Print accuracy score
print('Accuracy score is ', end="")
print('%.3f' % score)
Accuracy score is 0.984
 